TITLE_ABOUT=About HYDRA-UMC EDITOR-URDF
ABOUT_TAGLINE=Graphical URDF creator/editor for HYDRA-UMC-STUDIO's model catalog.
ABOUT_DESCRIPTION=Pull source files from GitHub or a local folder, resolve mesh references, validate DOF feasibility, and edit color, scale and joint limits with a live 3D preview before pushing the finished model to a running STUDIO server.
